{
  "uid": "opencraft-diagnostics",
  "title": "Diagnostics",
  "tags": [
    "opencraft",
    "engine"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "style": "dark",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Active Alarms",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "query": "from(bucket: v.defaultBucket)\n  |> range(start: -30s)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"notifications\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._field == \"state\" or r._field == \"severity\" or r._field == \"message\")\n  |> last()\n  |> pivot(rowKey: [\"path\"], columnKey: [\"_field\"], valueColumn: \"_value\")\n  |> group()\n  |> keep(columns: [\"path\", \"state\", \"severity\", \"message\"])\n  |> sort(columns: [\"severity\"], desc: true)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "state"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "normal": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "warn": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "alarm": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Data Source Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "query": "from(bucket: v.defaultBucket)\n  |> range(start: -5m)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"propulsion\" and r._field == \"revolutions\")\n  |> last()\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({ r with _value: float(v: int(v: now()) - int(v: r._time)) / 1000000000.0 }))\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"_value\"])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: s since last point",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "value": null,
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "value": 10,
                "color": "orange"
              },
              {
                "value": 30,
                "color": "red"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "ECU Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Not yet available.**\n\nNo physical ECU/SmartCraft interface is connected. This panel will show live ECU health and fault codes once SmartCraft CAN decoding is implemented (future milestone)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Gateway Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Not yet available.**\n\nNo physical OpenCraft gateway hardware is deployed. This panel will show gateway health (uptime, CAN bus status, publish errors) once the SmartCraft gateway is implemented (future milestone)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "⚠ REPLAY MODE",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The two panels below show replayed historical capture data, not the live vessel.** They only populate while `services/replay` is running against a captured log such as `master-test01.log` -- see `docs/replay.md`. Every value is a raw or hypothesis-tagged CAN field candidate (see `docs/master-test01-analysis.md`), never a confirmed, calibrated decode. Check the Replay Status panel's `capture`/`state` columns before trusting anything in the Candidate Signals table."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Replay Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "query": "from(bucket: v.defaultBucket)\n  |> range(start: -30s)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"replay_status\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._field == \"state\" or r._field == \"position_s\" or r._field == \"duration_s\" or r._field == \"pct_complete\" or r._field == \"speed\")\n  |> last()\n  |> pivot(rowKey: [\"capture\"], columnKey: [\"_field\"], valueColumn: \"_value\")\n  |> group()\n  |> keep(columns: [\"capture\", \"state\", \"speed\", \"position_s\", \"duration_s\", \"pct_complete\"])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "state"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "playing": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "paused": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "finished": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "stopped": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 3
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "pct_complete"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "position_s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "duration_s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Candidate Signals (Replay)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "query": "from(bucket: v.defaultBucket)\n  |> range(start: -30s)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"can_replay\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._field == \"value\" or r._field == \"confidence_pct\")\n  |> last()\n  |> pivot(rowKey: [\"hypothesis\", \"tier\"], columnKey: [\"_field\"], valueColumn: \"_value\")\n  |> group()\n  |> keep(columns: [\"hypothesis\", \"tier\", \"value\", \"confidence_pct\"])\n  |> sort(columns: [\"tier\", \"hypothesis\"])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "tier"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "hypothesis": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "raw": {
                        "color": "gray",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "confidence_pct"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "-1": {
                        "text": "unscored"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Replay Signal Estimates (GUESSED calibration)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Every gauge below applies a labeled guess on top of the raw CAN value -- not a confirmed decode.** Scale/offset per candidate are in `services/replay/app/candidates.py` (`Guess`), each cited to a section of `docs/master-test01-analysis.md`. Hover a gauge's info icon for its specific basis -- some are fitted to a real field-sheet reading, some are pure unanchored placeholder assumptions (noted on each). A number here looking 'wrong' (e.g. Fuel reading ~2% when the real tank was ~100%) is itself useful evidence against that candidate/assumption, not a sign of a real state change."
      }
    },
